{"4627300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Defender Zed-001", "steam_appid": 4627300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4663530], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFENDER ZED-001</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Defender Zed-001 and survive relentless waves of enemy forces in this fast-paced arcade space shooter. Every run is a test of skill, strategy, and reaction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS ARCADE ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face escalating waves of enemies that grow more aggressive and unpredictable. One mistake can end your run—stay sharp and keep moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627300/extras/f260f58c3f2e7e112f4007b234cba2c1.avif?t=1777826193\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE BETWEEN ROUNDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose powerful upgrades between waves to adapt your strategy. Build for damage, defense, or survival—every choice matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILL-BASED GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master  timing and target priority to survive longer and push your limits. The deeper you go, the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627300/extras/4952ed32ddc7ef5de7b0ca9f159a4b19.avif?t=1777826193\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSH YOUR LIMITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive? Each run is a chance to go further, improve your performance, and chase your best run.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFENDER ZED-001</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Defender Zed-001 and survive relentless waves of enemy forces in this fa